msgid ""
"Devices keep talking to each other and to the router — only the way out is close"
"d. Traffic is stopped on the way in, so a transparent proxy on the router (podko"
"p, passwall) cannot carry it out either. Remote access that reaches the router t"
"hrough a LAN host (Tailscale, a tunnel, a jump host) stops working while this is"
" on."
msgstr ""
"设备之间及与路由器仍可通信 — 只是对外出口被关闭。入站流量也被阻止，因此路由器上的透明代理（podkop、passwall）也无法将其带出。通过 LAN 主机"
"（Tailscale、隧道、跳转主机）到达路由器的远程访问在此期间停止工作。"

msgid ""
"Devices on the WiFi deny list that are still connected — those blocks are not in"
" effect on the running radio."
msgstr "仍在连接的 WiFi 拒绝列表设备 — 这些阻断在当前无线未生效。"

