msgid "Flow Offload"
msgstr "流卸载"

msgid ""
"Flow offload is active and the kernel does not support the nftables counter maps"
" trafficctl uses in that mode, so byte counters stop updating for offloaded conn"
"ections. Speeds and totals would be far too low, so they are not shown. Disablin"
"g hardware offload in Settings → Flow Offload restores them."
msgstr ""
"流卸载已启用，但内核不支持 trafficctl 在该模式下使用的 nftables 计数器映射，因此卸载连接的字节计数器停止更新。速度和总计会严重偏低，故不显"
"示。在 设置 → 流卸载 中关闭硬件卸载可恢复。"

msgid "Flow: /devices → select device → inline keyboard with enabled actions above"
msgstr "流程：/devices → 选择设备 → 使用上方启用的操作内联键盘"

msgid "Flows"
msgstr "流数"

msgid ""
"Forwarded traffic only — this kernel cannot install the prerouting rule, so traf"
"fic handled by a transparent proxy on the router would not be caught."
msgstr "仅转发流量 — 此内核无法安装 prerouting 规则，因此路由器上透明代理处理的流量不会被捕获。"

