msgid ""
"Not counted: flow offload is active and this router cannot provide the nftables "
"counters trafficctl uses in that mode, so the kernel byte counters stop updating"
" for offloaded connections. Any total here would be far too low. See Settings → "
"Flow Offload."
msgstr ""
"未计数：流卸载已启用，此路由器无法提供 trafficctl 在该模式下使用的 nftables 计数器，因此内核字节计数器停止更新。任何显示值都会严重偏低。参"
"见 设置 → 流卸载。"

