"Not measurable while flow offload is active: in that mode the router counts byte"
"s per address only, so traffic cannot be split by protocol. See Settings → Flow "
"Offload."
msgstr "流卸载启用时无法测量：该模式下路由器仅按地址计数字节，因此无法按协议拆分。参见 设置 → 流卸载。"

