msgid ""
"Offloads routing to the hardware engine (PPE/NPU). Requires software offload. ⚠ "
"On many platforms (e.g. Mediatek Filogic) the driver does not report byte counte"
"rs back to the kernel — real-time speed monitoring will show zero."
msgstr ""
"将路由卸载到硬件引擎（PPE/NPU）。需要软件卸载。⚠ 在许多平台（如 Mediatek Filogic）上，驱动不会将字节计数器报告回内核 — 实时速度监控"
"将显示为零。"

